{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51204","headline":"五言白话诗 十一 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从头捉将去，「顽骨」不心擎。\n（「顽骨」二字据斯五六四一卷补。\n「擎」，斯五六四一卷作「惊」。\n）虽然畜两眼，终是一双盲。\n向前黑如漆，直掇入深坑。\n沉沦苦海里，何日更逢明？。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}